                over the point should be
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3d+Chern-Simons+theory"} 3d Chern-Simons theory
                in dimension 2 (hence the
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modular+functor"} modular functor
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/extended+TQFT"} localized
                to dimensions 1 and 0 as a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+prequantum+field+theory"} local prequantum field theory
                and including its
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+geometric+quantization"} higher geometric quantization
                in these dimensions 0,1, and 2
              \.
          %blockquote
