                ,
                %em Orientations and Topological Modular Forms with Level Structure
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1507.05116"}> arXiv:1507.05116
                )
            %h4#equivariant_elliptic_genera Equivariant elliptic genera
            %p
              Genera in
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+elliptic+cohomology"} equivariant elliptic cohomology
              and the
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rigidity+theorem+for+equivariant+elliptic+genera"} rigidity theorem for equivariant elliptic genera
            %p
              The statement, with a
              = succeed "-motivated" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#Witten87"} Witten 87
            %p
